'RectangleCLT.Companion.SplitV4.denseMomentOptimal' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
Audited 56 fixed-envelope q>4 lower theorem declarations, each transitively; only the permitted three axioms.
Theorem 7 is proved for actual iid centrally symmetric observations in the literal polynomial class. Its terminal hypotheses are only q>4, B>=2, m tending to infinity and V tending to zero. The full rectangle-distance lower limit is strictly positive; both actual suprema satisfy the stated lower rate and the upper logarithmic comparison, with upper coefficient depending only on q.
